// Title: Service StartupType Change Via Sc.EXE
// Rule ID: 85c312b7-f44d-4a51-a024-d671c40b49fc
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1562.001
// Category: process_creation
